# Copy this to .env and adjust for how you're running the backend.
#
# This points at the real ParentOS/Uusiksi backend (Documents/parentos/
# backend) - the same one the web frontend talks to, not a backend in this
# repo. Its routes are mounted under /api/v1 (see backend/config.js's
# API_PREFIX), so that prefix must be included here.
#
# - iOS simulator on the same Mac as the backend: default (localhost) works.
# - Android emulator: use 10.0.2.2, the emulator's alias for the host machine.
# - Physical device (Expo Go / dev build): use your computer's LAN IP, e.g.
#   http://192.168.1.23:4000/api/v1 — localhost on a phone means the phone itself.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1
